        requests_i_j_x_k_l_s_corrected(i, j, s, l, k, x)  of number
        requests_i_j_k_l_s_corrected.First of matrix(Product, Refinery, Ship_terms, Market_participant, Region)
        requests_i_j_x_k_l_s_corrected     of matrix(Product, Refinery, Ship_terms, Market_participant, Region, Terminal)
